  "description": "<center><img src=\"http://ia331430.us.archive.org/3/items/sci_fi_logo2_228/newmain.JPG\" border=\"0\"></center><br>The Science Fiction and Fantasy Fiction Collection is comprised of public domain books contributed by <a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/specialcollections/researchlibrary/index.cfm\">The Charles E. Young Research Library Department of Special Collections</a> at UCLA from the Nitka Collection of Fantastic Fiction. Other contributions are from the <a href=\"http://www.archive.org/details/university_of_toronto\">University of Toronto</a> and the <a href=\"http://www.archive.org/details/university_of_california_libraries\">University of California at Berkeley</a>.\r\n<br>\r\n<br><li>Read more <a href=\"http://www.archive.org/search.php?query=collection%3Asciencefiction%20\">Science Fiction and Fantasy Fiction Collection</a></li><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" cellpadding=\"2\">\r\n\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n    <td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#DDDDDD\"><b>Classics </b></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/flatlandromanceo00abbouoft\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"http://www.archive.org/download/flatlandromanceo00abbouoft/flatlandromanceo00abbouoft.gif\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<b>Flatland : A Romance of many Dimensions</b> <font size=\"-1\"><br>(<a href=\"../details/flatlandromanceo00abbouoft\">details</a> | <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/flatlandromanceo00abbouoft\">read it</a>)</font><br>\r\nby Edwin Abbott Abbott (1838-1926)<br>\r\nPublished in 1884<br>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\nThe War of the Worlds by H. G. Wells\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/warofworlds00welluoft\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/warofworlds00welluoft\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nTwenty Thousand Leagues Under the Sea by Jules Verne\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/twentythousandle00verniala\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/twentythousandle00verniala\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nThe Centaur by Algernon Blackwood\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/centaurthe00blacuoft\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/centaurthe00blacuoft\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n    <td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#DDDDDD\"><b>Tarzan Series by Edgar Rice Burroughs</b></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\nTarzan of the Apes\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/tarzanoftheapes00burrrich\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/tarzanoftheapes00burrrich\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nThe Return of Tarzan\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/returnoftarzan00burrrich\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/returnoftarzan00burrrich\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nTarzan the Untamed<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/tarzanuntamed00burriala\">details</a> | <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/tarzanuntamed00burriala\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>Read more <a href=\"http://www.archive.org/search.php?query=-collection%3A%22gutenberg%22%20AND%20title%3Atarzan%20AND%20%28Burroughs%2C%20Rice%20AND%20mediatype%3Atexts%29\">Tarzan titles</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n    <td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#DDDDDD\"><b>Fantasy Adventures</b></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\nOnce On a Time by A. A. Milne\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/onceontime00miln\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/onceontime00miln\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nGulliver's Travels into Lilliput and Brobdingnag by Jonathan Swift\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/gulliverstravels00swif2\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/gulliverstravels00swif2\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nA Connecticut Yankee in King Arthur's Court by Mark Twain\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/connecticutyanke00twaiuoft\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/connecticutyanke00twaiuoft\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nThe Lost World by Sir Arthur Conan Doyle <font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/lostworld00doyluoft\">details</a> | <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/lostworld00doyluoft\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n    <td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#DDDDDD\"><b>Tales of Horror and Suspense</b></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\nThe Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde by Robert Louis Stevenson\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/strangecaseofdr00stevuoft\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/strangecaseofdr00stevuoft\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nThe Island of Dr. Moreau: A Possibility by H. G. Wells\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/islandofdoctormo00welluoft\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/islandofdoctormo00welluoft\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nFrankenstein; or, the Modern Prometheus\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/ghostseer01schiuoft\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/ghostseer01schiuoft\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n<li>\r\nAlraune, die Geschichte eines lebenden Wesens by Hanns Heinz Ewers\r\n<font size=\"-1\">(<a href=\"../details/alraunediegeschi00eweruoft\">details</a>  |  <a href=\"http://www.openlibrary.org/details/alraunediegeschi00eweruoft\">read it</a>)</font></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n    <td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" bgcolor=\"#DDDDDD\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\nMany books sponsored by <a href=\"../details/msn_books\">Microsoft</a>, and contributed by <